cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or reference this project, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "IA Gesture: Real-Time Hand-Gesture Recognition and IoT Assistive System"
abstract: >
  IA Gesture is an accessibility-focused system that translates hand
  gestures into readable/audible messages in real time. It combines
  computer vision (OpenCV, MediaPipe), a machine learning gesture
  classifier (scikit-learn), MQTT-based IoT communication, and an
  ESP32/ESP8266 embedded assistant with an OLED display, buzzer, and
  ultrasonic sensor, designed to support non-verbal, hearing-impaired,
  and visually-impaired users.
